## Integration acceptance

- Test observed/forecast periods, missing units/times and partial forecasts against their provider model.
- Check successful empty, failed, out-of-scope and expired warning responses separately.
- Verify warning language/attribution remain unchanged by all palettes and no new severity is inferred from colour.

Record actual environment, versions, state, method and result using the [native task accessibility matrix](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a local example do not establish physical execution, screen-reader usability or live compatibility.

